    <briefdescription>
<para>Deterministic edge-case detection and handling for the Updates module (Phase 4). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="version"><para>1.0.0 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="since"><para>2.4.0 (Q4 2026)</para>
</simplesect>
Provides <computeroutput>UpdatesEdgeCaseHandler</computeroutput>, a stateful, thread-safe class that inspects an <computeroutput>UpdateStateMachine</computeroutput> snapshot and context hints to classify edge-case conditions that fall outside the normal IDLE → DOWNLOADING → VERIFYING → APPLYING → IDLE happy path.</para>
<para>Error code range covered: [7400–7499] (Updates module reserved range).</para>
<para>Typical usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">UpdatesEdgeCaseHandler<sp/>handler;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>result<sp/>=<sp/>handler.detectAndHandle(state_machine,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;post-apply&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(result.handled)<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(handler.isFatal(result.error_code))<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>escalate</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>}<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">else</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(result.requires_rollback)<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>trigger<sp/>rollback<sp/>path</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>Doxygen maturity: 🟢 PRODUCTION-READY </para>
